RELEASE NOTES, c3p0-0.11.1
==========================

This is a quick, bug-fix release.

In c3p0-0.11.0, forceKillAcquires() accidentally failed to surrender its lock,
leading to deadlocks in applications following a full round of acquisition failures.

Many thanks to @pwielgolaski on github for tracking down the issue, and to
@michalgutkowski on github for providing a pull request with the fix.

Thanks also to @driseley on github for providing a reproduction of the issue.
